// `wasmEmit.vl` — the emitter's lowering core: the statement and expression lowerers
// (`emitStmt` / `emitExpr` and the per-node `emit*` families — calls, assignment,
// object/array/map construction, unions, closures, string and list ops, coalescing)
// that turn arena nodes into WasmGC instruction bytes inside a function body.
//
// One layer of the emitter module stack: `emit_classify.vl` answers what type and rep a
// node lowers as, `emit_collect.vl` pre-fills the shared tables, `emit_rewrite.vl` and
// `emit_mono.vl` mutate the arena first, `emit_bytes.vl` owns the byte encodings,
// `emit_state.vl` the shared globals, and `emit_sections.vl` drives `emitProgram`'s pass
// table and assembles the module sections around the bodies lowered here.
